and we have a large for,

00:27:32.006 --> 00:27:37.006
I don't wanna discount that
but I think I didn't see

00:27:37.236 --> 00:27:41.226
this as being as divisive
as it has turned out

00:27:41.226 --> 00:27:44.496
but it's part of the story
we'll continue to cover it.

00:27:44.496 --> 00:27:48.016
We as one of the franchises
we do facts over fear,

00:27:48.016 --> 00:27:50.886
that's one of our guiding
principles of how we covered

00:27:50.886 --> 00:27:52.869
the pandemic and we will march forward.

